codes, quests and offline cash\n- Anti-AFK: the game's own 15-minute idle rejoin is switched off\n\nMOBILE\nWorks on PC and mobile - the panel asks once and scales itself, and it speaks English, German and Russian. Every setting survives a rejoin.\n\nHOW TO RUN\n1. Open Build and Kill Zombies\n2. Paste the loader into your executor\n3. Execute - the panel opens by itself\n4. Press RightShift to show or hide it\n\nFree and keyless. No Robux purchases are ever touched - Instant Buy, the Starter/Pro/Zeus packs and the offline tripler stay shut.\n\nOpen source, read it before you run it:\nhttps://github.com/seltonmt012/sel01-rbx/blob/main/games/buildzombies.lua\nDiscord: https://discord.gg/ARdpzFuKMm","tags":["auto farm","auto drive","auto roll","auto build","no key"],"script":"loadstring(game:HttpGet(\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/seltonmt012/sel01-rbx/main/loader.lua\"))()","owner":{"_id":"6a83833ecf50fbf20351384b","username":"Seltonmt","verified":false,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/0ded360520c1951d28fd502cf078aeca6b05bb87c667cba5445a03bd584b31ec.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/6a83833ecf50fbf20351384b-1787205594420.png"},"lvl":7,"status":"offline","id":"6a83833ecf50fbf20351384b","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.executions","tier":10000},"profile":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/0ded360520c1951d28fd502cf078aeca6b05bb87c667cba5445a03bd584b31ec.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/6a83833ecf50fbf20351384b-1787205594420.png"}},"verified":false,"keyless":false,"discord":"https://discord.gg/ARdpzFuKMm","views":4132,"executes":11570,"scriptType":"free","isUniversal":false,"isPatched":false,"visibility":"public","image":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/fa65ab3fb615486b81e77053916fffe1881281e233b547a9fab8d58365063eb8.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/sb/105011592530400-1790751334905.png","scriptblox":"https://scriptblox.com/images/script/105011592530400-1790751334905.png"},"likeCount":1,"